## Model card

- **Name:** Kimi K2.8 Preview
- **Short description:** Moonshot AI's coding- and agent-focused Preview model (rolling rollout 2026-09-11), positioned between Kimi K2.7 Code and the flagship Kimi K3; a 1M-token context upgrade over K2.7 Code's 256K.
- **Provider / access:** Moonshot AI — via Kimi Code / Kimi Code CLI / Kimi Work through the existing `kimi-for-coding` route (reportedly auto-routes to K2.8 without a model-ID change); also reachable via third-party tools (Qoder, Cindy). No dedicated public API endpoint or model ID confirmed. Not listed on OpenCode Zen.
- **Release / knowledge:** Rolling Preview rollout reported 2026-09-11 (llm-stats, kie.ai, kucoin.com); knowledge cutoff not disclosed.
- **IDs:** `kimi-for-coding` (Kimi Code route, third-party reported to point to K2.8 Preview); no confirmed dedicated API model ID; no OpenCode Zen ID.
- **Context window:** Up to 1.0M tokens (llm-stats.com; multiple third-party reports; vs 256K for Kimi K2.7 Code).
- **Modalities:** Text in/out; image and video input reported (llm-stats lists text/image/video in) but not independently confirmed.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-09-28):** Not confirmed by Moonshot. Single third-party gateway price sheet lists $1 input / $4 output per 1M tokens (Cindy Gateway, 2026-09-14, via kie.ai) — uncorroborated, treat as provisional.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary (Moonshot AI); parameter count not disclosed.

