### Verification steps performed (2026-09-28)

1. llm-stats.com/models/kimi-k2.8 — page confirms 1.0M context, multimodal (text/image/video in), 2026-09-11 release; no benchmark score table populated.
2. kie.ai/blog/what-is-kimi-k2-8 (updated 2026-09-16) — "independent benchmark scores are not yet available"; hands-on tests mixed ("not at the same level of K3, but faster"); only a single-source $1/$4 price sheet.
3. emergent.sh news (2026-09-14/15) — "pricing and benchmark details expected in coming weeks."
4. kucoin.com news flash (2026-09-11) — "performance near K3" (vendor relayed claim, no numbers); `kimi-for-coding` ID confirmed.
5. No K2.8 Preview entries found on the Artificial Analysis LLM leaderboard, BenchLM, or xAI/AA coding-agent leaderboards.

### Disposition

- Kimi K2.8 Preview has verified product specs (1M context, multimodal input, low/high/max thinking, `kimi-for-coding` routing) but zero verified public benchmark numbers as of 2026-09-28.
- A scored `Qwen_3.8_27B.md` can replace this exclusion on a future re-research pass once independent/vendor benchmark numbers (GPQA, SWE-bench, Terminal-Bench, AA Index, etc.) are published.

